Type: project
Title: London air pollution and health
Description: What a 1 µg/m³ cut in annual mean PM2.5 is worth in each London
    borough, using OHID Fingertips and ONS data, SQL in DuckDB, an R life-table
    QALY model and a Quarto dashboard. This file lists the packages renv
    records in renv.lock.
